2 CONT
2 CONT Married:
2 CONT #[http://www.geni.com/people/Diego-de-Medina/6000000001500800498 Diego de Medina]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Maria Zapata and Diego de Medina:
2 CONT #[http://www.geni.com/people/Ramon-Medina/6000000001500764145?through=6000000013126624193 Ramon de Medina]
2 CONT #[http://www.geni.com/people/Juana-de-Medina/6000000001500764096 Juana de Medina]
