2 CONT
2 CONT Montoya. Film: 0016964 Batch C512792. 1872 Baptisms.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their first child Jose Ysabel Montoya was baptized at the Mission de San Lorenzo De Picuris in April 1864.
2 CONT
2 CONT Frank Montoya and wife (Maria) Gertrudez are the godparent of Juan Paolo Montoya and Maria Dolores Medina's child Jose
2 CONT
2 CONT Ysabel Montoya.
