1 NAME Felicitas /Granillo/
2 GIVN Felicitas
2 SURN Granillo
2 _MARNM Zamora
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Evergreen Alameda Cemetery - Section Z
2 ADDR
3 CITY El Paso
