1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maria Ignacia Jaramillo was born in 1815 to an old and distinguished Taos family.  In 1829 she married Jose Rafael Luna, a shopkeeper and head of the customs house in Taos.  Their only child was''' Maria Rumalda, b
2 CONC orn in 1831.'''  Not long after her birth, Rafael died.  Ignacia, as was the custom then, converted back to her maiden name.
