2 CONT In Los Angeles Times July 22, 1938. Obituary for Charles Carson son of Kit Carson.
2 CONT Son of Kit Carson Dies at 77 Years, LaJunta (Colo.) July 21.
2 CONT Charles Carson, 77 years of age, son of the famed pioneer Indian scout, Kit Carson, died here today after a brief illness.  The last surviving member of Kit Carson's immediate family.  Charles Carson had lived on a ranch near Higb
2 CONC ee, in Southern Colorado, since 1884.
2 CONT
