1 NOTE {geni:about_me} MARRIAGE: HGRC San Juan de los Caballeros Marriages, p. 12. (p.42 of church record.) 20 Dec 1859. Married and veiled Pedro Antonio Cordoba single, legitimate son of Jose Patricio Cordoba & Maria Ramona Olivas w/ Ma
2 CONC ria Rosa Archuleta single, legitimate daughter of Ramon Archuleta & Maria Rosa Martin. The groom resident of Nuestra Senora del Rosario of Las Truchas and the bride from La Plaza del Alcalde. listed as parent in 1861 bap of "Teres
2 CONC a de Jesus" in San Juan de los Caballeros Baptisms 1726-1870 (compiled by Tom Martinez) p. 104. Teresa de Jesus (7 days). bap 8/24/1861. Parents: Pedro Antonio Cordova & Maria Rosa Archuleta, vecinos de Las Truchas. PGP & MGP: not
2 CONC  listed Padrinos: Antonio de Jesus Archuleta & Maria Teodora Pacheco.
