2 CONT Tomasita have a daughter names Juanita MontoyaLucero. 
2 CONT Is this your grandmother?He had Libritia (Libby) daughter 
2 CONT who wasblind. She married a man who was also blind and 
2 CONT she would take care of her father. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Another daughter Manualita, married Jose Medina. 
2 CONT Jose was a brother to Gregoria (Grace) Medina who 
2 CONT married Fermin Espinoza. Gregoria had asister named 
