2 NOTE Do you remember "Gerr Animal" clothes for kids, do you think grandpa wore them too...LOL
2 NOTE Yep grandma was the BEST!!!! Always wanted to give you cookies, or something until you said ok, always wanting to feed us when we went to visit. 
2 NOTE Yes!  I'm sure that we all agree on that we had the best Grandparents ever!  I remember her little laugh she would give when she made a mistake..........I remember her calling my Grandpa, "pendejo" when he would trip the little on
3 CONC e (whomever) that was learning to walk!   I remember how sad my Grandpa was when Grandma went to California one time...He had true love for her tho' he tried to pretend he didn't.  
2 NOTE Thank you.
2 NOTE Out of all the children in the Suazo Clan, Rosanne looks the most like my grandma
2 NOTE I love my Grandma's smile.
