1 NAME Fredrico /Sanchez/
2 GIVN Fredrico
2 _MARNM Sanchez
1 SEX M
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Information by Joseph H. Sanchez, 2nd Great Nephew
2 CONT
2 CONT As the oldest son in the family, he should have inherited the responsibility of running the day to day needs of the family ranch, but due to the fact that he was in prison, his younger brother Ubaldo fulfilled this obligation. Fre
2 CONC d was in prison for the passionate murder of a woman, as told by family members. Fred was released from prison only to find that the Great Depression had destroyed the viability of the family ranch. He and all his siblings packed 
2 CONC up and for some reason moved to Los Angeles to start a new life.
2 CONT
2 CONT He never married and died at the family home on Normandy Blvd, in Los Angeles, where he live with some of his siblings.
