1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anita married Maximillio Romero son of Jose Placido Romero and moved with her husband from Belen, New Mexico  to San Bernadino, California during the Great Depression of the 1930's. Her brother Uvaldo Isadore Sanch
2 CONC ez  married the sister of Maximillo whose name was Rosela and they are my great grand parents and after she died in childbirth my great grand father Uvaldo move to Los Angeles along with his brother and sisters during the Great De
2 CONC pression. That is how my Sanchez family ended up in Los Angeles after being in New Mexico since 1598.
