1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Nina Salas was a well loved grandmother. She was warm and friendly. When Gene was a boy she use to send him to the corner store to buy her tobacco. He also use to help her pick the herbs from her garden that she us
2 CONC ed as a Curandera. Nina Salas’s mother was also a Curandera. Gene remembers the time he spent with Grandma Nina to be some of the happiest memories of his childhood.  - As told to Marci Hoff by Gene Duran 
