1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From his Find A Grave page:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/59872936/alfred-torrez
2 CONT
2 CONT Alfred served during the Korean War from 5 Apr 1951 to 31 Jan 1954 (VA). He served with Company G of the 14th Infantry Regiment. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The 14th Infantry Regiment (Golden Dragons), under the 25th Infantry Division, was in almost constant combat along the 38th parallel defending places like "The Punchbowl" and "Porkchop Hill". The 14th Infantry's service in Korea e
2 CONC arned the Regiment five campaign streamers and the Republic of Korea Presidential Unit Citation for gallantry at Munsan-Ni. 
2 CONT
