1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From telling of older family members, adopted by Jose Gregorio Aragon & wife Leandra Vigil. Birth parents were an unknown brother of Jose Gregorio & Zuni Indian servant in the household. Birth mother died when Rita
2 CONC  was a toddler. Had a full sister, Timotea. Timotea  was adopted by grandparents, Manuel Aragon & Maria de Teresa Baca. These two girls were true Aragon blood, so they were kept within the family.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Vigil was an adopted line.
