1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When Solomon Vigil was born on August 25, 1902, in Albuquerque, New Mexico, his father, Jose, was 26 and his mother, Ana, was 21. He married Josephine Vigil on November 20, 1922, in Bernalillo, New Mexico. They had
2 CONC  two children during their marriage. He died on July 21, 1964, in Los Angels, California, at the age of 61.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1920 Census.  Solomon age 18.  Occupation listed as Soda Dispenser, Hotel.
2 CONT * 1924 Birth Certificate for son.  Occupation listed as Laborer, Machine Shop.
