1 OCCU Home Maker and Mother of 9 Children
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mother of 7 children at the time of census of June 28th, 1900 only 2 of her children were alive Evaristo and Ecolastica, the other two were not born yet.  Benico and Rufino were not born yet.  My Grandfather Rufino
2 CONC  Garcia told me his Mom Crusita had 13 children I was only able to find 9 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was 13 years old when she married her husband who was 23 years old.  Her Mother Socorro Was 13 when she married her husband who was 29 years old.    These ages are recorded in the state records.
2 CONT
2 CONT I found the Baptismal Certificates for both Crusita and her sister Maria Ursula Vigil
