1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Refer to text for Juan Zamora[Prather Family.FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT Found Alexandria in Denver Colorado 1910 census. Found Alexandria in Long Beach, California in 1930 census. Believe that Alexandria was in Pocatello, Idaho in 1920, have not found census record as of 6/8/2003. Found Alexandria in 
2 CONC Pocatello, Idaho 1920 with second husband and two of her sons.  Transcription of last name was Gheeon, NOT Chacon.
2 CONT
2 CONT Found Miss Alexandria Gilbert in Denver, Colorado 1910 city directory.
2 CONT
2 CONT Went to street intersection where Alexandria lived in 1910, did not take exact address with at the time, therefore, did not take a picture of the actual house.  I was on the wrong side of the drainage ditch.  The houses in the are
2 CONC a that I was in were very quaint and old, some were of rather nice stature and others were duplexes.
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Source ===
2 CONT Citation Text: Alexandrium Gilbert baptized 1894, parents Jacobo Gilbert and Martina Seiler. Sponsors Benito Seiler and Juanita Cena
2 CONT === GEDCOM Source ===
