1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From the Rancho Pancho website, compiled by Claire Ortiz Hill
2 CONT
2 CONT http://rancho.pancho.pagesperso-orange.fr/Sofio.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Sofio Ortiz was born on September 1, 1883 in Santa Fe and died November 17, 1966 in Capulin, CO. 
2 CONT
2 CONT His parents were Francisco Ortiz y Romero and Alcaria Barbero y Valencia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT His siblings were 
2 CONT *Antonia Ortiz y Barbero de Callahan, 
2 CONT *Lourdes Ortiz y Barbero de Howland and 
2 CONT *Francisco Valencia Ortiz y Barbero. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Rufina Rivera, born July 1, 1891 in Cuyamunge NM and died October 4, 1967 in Capulin. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children were 
2 CONT *Helen (married Juan V. Garcia), 
2 CONT *Alfonso, 
2 CONT *Maria Angelica (Sister Juanita), 
2 CONT *Roberto, 
2 CONT *Estella, 
2 CONT *Francisco, 
2 CONT *Maria Corina (married William K. Gibson), 
2 CONT *Viola (married Joe E. Maestas), 
2 CONT *Andres, 
2 CONT *Fedelina, 
2 CONT *Veronica.
2 CONT
2 CONT --
