2 CONT
2 CONT Santa Fe (AP) - Funeral services have been set for Saturday for New Mexico political leader Frank V. Ortiz.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ortiz, a former chairman of the state Democratic Party, died Tuesday of pneumonia at St. Vincent Hospital. He was 95.
2 CONT
2 CONT Services were held at 11 a.m. at St. Francis Cathedral with private burial services to follow in Rosario Cemetery.
