2 CONT Attended public schools in Questa and El Rito Spanish American Normal School. He was student at Highland University.  For 2 and a half terms he taught school in Questa then he was elected County School Superintendent, resining lat
2 CONC er and going back to teaching another year.  Prior to becoming Postmaster of Questa in 1926 her served part of one term as clerk in the County Superintendtant's Office.  Mr Rael organized his mercantile busniess and began cattle a
2 CONC nd sheep ranching simultaneously with his postion as Postmaster, operating all three enterprises continusly for the past 18 years. 
