1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Her real birthday was February 17, 1916 - born at Valle de Zaragosa (Pilar de Conchos), Chihuahua, Mexico, and her birth name was Felicitas Ronquillo, after her maternal grandmother. Her fake birthday is May 15, 19
2 CONC 16, born in Clifton, Arizona, and when she was still a very young child and her Aunt Wanda was creating a forged birth certificate for her, she was asked what name she wanted and she said "Marian" so that is what her forged certif
2 CONC icate had and what she used going forward.  She used to own her own hair salon, and also worked for the Golden Door Spa in San Diego for a while (http://www.goldendoor.com/default-en.html).  While working there the staff were not 
2 CONC supposed to talk with the guests if they were celebrities, however one guest was Jonathan Winters who got her into trouble for laughing too much at his jokes while she was working on him.  She also worked on Clint Walker who was r
2 CONC eportedly very tall compared to her.
2 CONT
