1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Margarita 'Maggie' Lucero, 94, a resident of Barstow for 49 years, passed away July 28, 2005 at Barstow Community Hospital. She was born June 3, 1911 in New Mexico. She was a homemaker for 74 years. She was an avid
2 CONC  bingo player and had many friends through bingo. Survivors include her daughters, Valentina Cardenas of Victorville, Angie Gould of La Crescenta, Helen Baca of Lenwood, and Cecilia Rodriguez of Barstow; sons, Gilbert Lucero and F
2 CONC red Lucero of Barstow, and Ruben Lucero of Hesperia; 46 grandchildren, 34 great-grandchildren, and nine great-great-grandchildren.  Desert Dispatch Tuesday, August 02, 2005 
