1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT To the son of Jose Alvino Sanchez 
2 CONT
2 CONT HI my name is Joseph H. Sanchez and we are cousins. I am the other Y-DNA  male for the Sanchez family going back to Jacinto Sanchez de Inigo. Your tree is private so I can not reach out to you. Would you contact me on my site beca
2 CONC use it is a public tree. I live in Boulder Colorado now since moving from Los Angeles a while ago. We have a lot of connections on the Geni trees and I would be interested in knowing about our family in New Mexico. I have created 
2 CONC a large family tree and  you might be interested in viewing it . I am also directly related to Pedro Sanchez de Inigo. My grandfather moved to Los Angeles during the great depression along with some of his family, they were from B
2 CONC elen and had a ranch with 1,200 sheep and 150 cattle. They lost everything during the great depression and moved to Los Angeles.
