2 NOTE I don't remember Errett when we were children.  I do remember that he made a cave (?) with Uncle Ernie's tennis court next do to his house.  I remember Merle being in a play, wearing a beautiful paper costume.  Clare, I don't reme
3 CONC mber at all.  I was born in 1928, I should have remembered.  However, I  remember sleeping with Aunt Jessie and Uncle Louis at the time of the Lindberg (?) kidnapping.  Was also at their home when one of the rolling dirt storms ca
3 CONC me through.  Aunt Jessie walked the floor, saying that the world was coming to an end.  She was known for making her angel food cakes -- so light and delicious.  Was her family from the same area of OK  as the Lujan ranch?  Did sh
3 CONC e have more family?                 you're such a sweetie to provide so much information.  Are your daughters step sisters?  Is your husband deceased?        love, pkfriday
