1 CONT Killed during an explosion that occured at 2:00 in the afternoon at the Dupont-DeNemours Powder Company in Augusta, Colorado (near Aguilar, Colorado).  
1 CONT Cornelio had started working at the powder plant the day before the explosion occured and was living in Augusta at the time of his death.
1 CONT Verdict Of Jury from an inquest held in Augusta, Colorado on July 7, 1917.
1 CONT That the above named (including C.C. Mestas) came to thir death at about 2:00 P.M. June 29, 1917 at the plant of the Dupont Powder Company at Augusta, Colorado from an explosion in the press and coining room.  From the evidence pr
1 CONC oduced we believe that the explosion was from some accidental cause unkown to this jury.  We further find that there was no neglect on the part of the company.
1 CONT
1 CONT Buried in Aguilar, Colorado. (Exact location unknown)
